          "symbol": "TransformerEncoder.forward",
          "expression": "def forward(self, src, mask: Optional[Tensor]=None, src_key_padding_mask: Optional[Tensor]=None, pos: Optional[Tensor]=None):\n    output = src\n    for layer in self.layers:\n        output = layer(output, src_mask=mask, src_key_padding_mask=src_key_padding_mask, pos=pos)\n    if self.norm is not None:\n        output = self.norm(output)\n    return output"
        }
      ],
